A student's quiz game uses the list questions (question text) and the list answers (correct answers), and the procedure below. responses is a list of the player's answers.
```
PROCEDURE score(answers, responses, penalty)
{
   points ← 0
   i ← 1
   REPEAT LENGTH(answers) TIMES
   {
      IF (responses[i] = answers[i])
      {
         points ← points + 10
      }
      ELSE
      {
         points ← points - penalty
      }
      i ← i + 1
   }
   RETURN(points)
}
```
